    "notes": "Three sessions. Track 1,2,4 (July 1957) — Monk-Coltrane quartet with Shadow Wilson and Wilbur Ware. Tracks 3,5 (June 26, 1957) — Monk's Music outtakes with septet including Copeland, Gryce, Hawkins, Blakey. Track 6 (April 12, 1957) — solo piano outtake from Thelonious Himself. Track 7 (April 12, 1957) — trio with Ware and Wilson, CD bonus. Engineer is not documented in available sources."
